specific clinical outcomes requiring specific dosages, or when you have a defensible insight about an ingredient combination. For first-time brand builders, private label is usually the right starting point.", "question": "When does custom formulation make more sense than private label?"}, {"answer": "Custom formulation involves R&D investment, stability testing, and higher production minimums to amortize those costs. Typical custom projects start in the low five-figures for the formulation work, plus minimum production runs in the low thousands of bottles. We provide specific pricing during scoping.", "question": "How much does custom formulation cost?"}, {"answer": "12 to 16 weeks from concept to production-ready inventory. The phases: concept refinement, formulation development, ingredient sourcing, prototype testing, stability validation, scale-up, and first production run.", "question": "How long does a custom formulation project take?"}, {"answer": "Yes. We have supplier relationships across most major branded ingredient companies (Sensoril, NKO, Curcumin C3, Wellmune, etc.). Branded ingredients add cost but give you marketing leverage and credibility. We help you decide where they're worth the premium.", "question": "Can I use branded ingredients in my custom formulation?"}], "max_width": 820, "module_id": 218940115739, "open_first": false, "question_size": 17, "section_eyebrow": "", "section_headline": "Frequently asked questions", "section_subhead": "<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; line-height: 27px\">None</p>", "style": {"background_color": {"color": "#F7F7F6", "opacity": 100}, "padding": {"padding_bottom": 80, "padding_top": 80}}, "text_color": "dark"}, "rowMetaData": [], "rows": [], "type": "module", "w": 0, "x": 0}}], "type": "cell", "w": 0, "x": 0}}, {"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "name": "column_8", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-column"}, "rowMetaData": [{"cssClass": "dnd-row"}], "rows": [{"0": {"cells": [], "